  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 605.10 Investigation Due to Discovery of Discharges from Unknown Sources",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 605.10 Investigation Due to Discovery of Discharges from Unknown Sources. When a discharge from an unknown source is discovered adjacent to a facility as defined in RSA 146-A:2, IX, RSA 146-C:1, V, or RSA 147-A:2, IV, the owner of such facility shall conduct an initial site characterization in accordance with Env-Or 605.07.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Or 600) #8812, eff 2-1-07; ss by #10831, eff 6-1-15; ss by #14419, eff 11-4-25, EXPIRES: 11-4-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-or600.html"
